EXPERIMENT 4 – CODE AND COMMANDS

File name: index.py

PROGRAM:

from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def home():
    return """
    <html>
    <head><title>GAE Launcher</title></head>
    <body>
    <h1>Hello from GAE Launcher</h1>
    <p>Second application on port 8081</p>
    </body>
    </html>
    """

if __name__ == '__main__':
    app.run(port=8081, debug=True)

COMMANDS:

pip install flask
python index.py

Browser:
http://localhost:8081/
